WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Look at the pale dot while keeping your eyes at the center.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Sometimes a peripheral shape fades, though the image remains in place.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Troxler fading depends on contrast, position, adaptation and eye movements.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Researchers compare changes in experience with what remains on the page.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Twelve-minute audio is a format. An hour of proven benefit is a different claim.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Try a free short practice, and ask what the study actually measured.
